  "description": {
    "text": "Tins of 2011, each with a holofoil Serperior BW20, Emboar BW21 or Samurott BW22, a figure of the same Pokémon, five booster packs (usually two Emerging Powers and one each of Black & White, Call of Legends and Triumphant) and a code card for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. Later shipments, sold at stores such as Walgreens, left out the figure and held three newer packs. Each promo reprints the Black & White set's holofoil card in art 5ban Graphics made only for English.",
